The '''HHMods Minimap''' plugin (part of the [[HHMods]] suite) adds a toggleable minimap HUD panel using the game's built-in <code>CompassPro</code> subsystem.

== Features ==

* '''Toggleable minimap panel''' with zoom and hotkey rebinding
* '''Public layer API''': other plugins can register POI layers on the minimap without hard-coupling
* '''Built-in layers''': Player Waypoints, Merchants
* '''Filter UI''': show / hide individual layers

== Cross-mod layers ==

Layers other HHMods plugins can register:

* '''Ore veins''' (from [[HHMods Perks]]' [[Geologist]] perk)

External mod authors can register additional layers via <code>HHMods.Minimap.LayerService.Register(LayerDefinition)</code>.

== Technical ==

The plugin hooks <code>World_Map_Mgr._CompassPro</code> and calls <code>CompassProPOI.RegisterPOI()</code> for each managed POI. Layer state is persisted via <code>HHMods.Core.ModSidecar</code>.

